@startuml
actor Client
participant IndividualsAPI
participant TransactionService
database TransactionDB
participant PaymentService
database PaymentServiceDB
participant FakePaymentProvider
database FakePaymentProviderDB

queue Kafka

== Init ==
Client -> IndividualsAPI: POST /api/v1/transactions/init (type=deposit)
IndividualsAPI -> TransactionService: POST /api/v1/transactions/init (type=deposit)
TransactionService -> TransactionService: Проверка кошелька
alt Пополнение возможно
    TransactionService --> IndividualsAPI: TransactionInitResponse
    IndividualsAPI --> Client: TransactionInitResponse
else Пополнение невозможно
    TransactionService --> IndividualsAPI: ErrorResponse
    IndividualsAPI --> Client: ErrorResponse
end
== Confirm ==
Client -> IndividualsAPI: POST /api/v1/transactions/confirm (type=deposit)
activate IndividualsAPI

IndividualsAPI -> TransactionService: POST /api/v1/transactions/confirm (type=deposit)
activate TransactionService
TransactionService -> TransactionService: Проверка кошелька
break Пополнение невозможно
    TransactionService --> IndividualsAPI: ErrorResponse
    IndividualsAPI --> Client: ErrorResponse
end

group transaction
    TransactionService -> TransactionDB: Создать транзакцию PENDING
    TransactionService -> Kafka: TransactionCreatedEvent
    TransactionDB --> TransactionService: OK, transactionId, PENDING
end
    TransactionService --> IndividualsAPI: TransactionConfirmResponse
    deactivate TransactionService
    IndividualsAPI -> PaymentService: POST /api/v1/payments
    activate PaymentService
    PaymentService -> PaymentServiceDB: Создать платеж со статусом PENDING
    PaymentService -> FakePaymentProvider: /api/v1/transactions
    FakePaymentProvider -> FakePaymentProviderDB: save transaction
    FakePaymentProviderDB --> FakePaymentProvider: OK, transactionId, PENDING
    FakePaymentProvider --> PaymentService: Транзакция со статусом PENDING
     PaymentService --> IndividualsAPI: PaymentResponse
    deactivate PaymentService

IndividualsAPI --> Client: TransactionConfirmResponse
deactivate IndividualsAPI

Kafka -> TransactionService: TransactionCompletedEvent (async)
TransactionService -> TransactionService: Зачислить средства
group transaction
    TransactionService -> TransactionDB: Баланс++
    TransactionService -> TransactionDB: Статус транзакции COMPLETED
end
@enduml